(7568361, 1214541, 50695, '<td valign="top">Very convincing teen sci-fi look.</td>', 'Very convincing teen sci-fi look.', '2018-05-13 12:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568362, 1214536, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fascinating tour de force that speaks for itself.  I have some confusion, but perhaps that''s a result of slapping rationality onto dream, myth.  Is water the home state being left behind by the shattered woman?  Could she be coming together?  Is this a take on Orpheus and Eurydice?  Maybe it''s better to set thinking aside.<br/>But this is fabulous.  The disintegration, the yearning hands, the gorgeous blue and green, the textures, the mood --  all superb. <br/>One of two personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A fascinating tour de force that speaks for itself.  I have some confusion, but perhaps that''s a result of slapping rationality onto dream, myth.  Is water the home state being left behind by the shattered woman?  Could she be coming together?  Is this a take on Orpheus and Eurydice?  Maybe it''s better to set thinking aside.But this is fabulous.  The disintegration, the yearning hands, the gorgeous blue and green, the textures, the mood --  all superb. One of two personal favorites of the challenge.', '2018-05-13 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568363, 1214542, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s someone on the left who''s leaning towards the dog, but it seems that this is about the dog and whoever''s calling him or her from behind the fence.  Or maybe I''m pushing my reading beyond the photographer''s intention, and the dog is merely being called back by his or her owner.  Anyway, it''s the picture in the challenge that breaks my heart.  There are several images that do a beautiful job of memorializing people, but this dog rushes at us like they do, full of love and eagerness.  The title resonates deeply.  The blur, the perspective and the action work harmoniously.  Those of us who have or once had a dog....<br/>One of two personal favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'There''s someone on the left who''s leaning towards the dog, but it seems that this is about the dog and whoever''s calling him or her from behind the fence.  Or maybe I''m pushing my reading beyond the photographer''s intention, and the dog is merely being called back by his or her owner.  Anyway, it''s the picture in the challenge that breaks my heart.  There are several images that do a beautiful job of memorializing people, but this dog rushes at us like they do, full of love and eagerness.  The title resonates deeply.  The blur, the perspective and the action work harmoniously.  Those of us who have or once had a dog....One of two personal favorites of the challenge.', '2018-05-13 16:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568365, 1214539, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, ethereal image.  It''s set up so strongly, yet the delicacy of emotion draws us in all the more deeply.  She''s hardly apparent, a glow, a memory.  The colors are warm and loving.  Heartfelt is too weak a word.</td>', 'A beautiful, ethereal image.  It''s set up so strongly, yet the delicacy of emotion draws us in all the more deeply.  She''s hardly apparent, a glow, a memory.  The colors are warm and loving.  Heartfelt is too weak a word.', '2018-05-13 16:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568368, 1214539, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite emotive.</td>', 'Quite emotive.', '2018-05-13 19:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568369, 1214544, 65234, '<td valign="top">:-(((</td>', ':-(((', '2018-05-13 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568370, 1214536, 65234, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here ... and I may have to keep studying the image till I figure it out! Fantastical.</td>', 'There''s a story here ... and I may have to keep studying the image till I figure it out! Fantastical.', '2018-05-13 19:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568371, 1214541, 65234, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t care to see this in my house!</td>', 'I wouldn''t care to see this in my house!', '2018-05-13 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568373, 1214544, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done Ken. 10 and blue.</td>', 'Beautifully done Ken. 10 and blue.', '2018-05-13 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568382, 1214544, 173844, '<td valign="top">Affectionate, evocative tribute.  Just to be able to chat again is all that''s desired, to be together.  Greg seems just inches from actual, engaged and at ease.  The fade is just enough to be tantalizing, the rolls in his sleeve intimate volume and presence.  The overall detail furthers the illusion.  The frame is full of light.  Quietly moving.</td>', 'Affectionate, evocative tribute.  Just to be able to chat again is all that''s desired, to be together.  Greg seems just inches from actual, engaged and at ease.  The fade is just enough to be tantalizing, the rolls in his sleeve intimate volume and presence.  The overall detail furthers the illusion.  The frame is full of light.  Quietly moving.', '2018-05-13 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568383, 1214527, 173844, '<td valign="top">Loved ones abide in memory, and in their pictures.  They still will listen to you, and you to them.  This diffuse image seems to be that place of intermingling, a renaissance of yesterdays.  It has nicely assorted lights and darks, is oddly but effectively composed.  Fine use of noise/grain to establish mood.</td>', 'Loved ones abide in memory, and in their pictures.  They still will listen to you, and you to them.  This diffuse image seems to be that place of intermingling, a renaissance of yesterdays.  It has nicely assorted lights and darks, is oddly but effectively composed.  Fine use of noise/grain to establish mood.', '2018-05-13 23:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568385, 1214347, 173844, '<td valign="top">Spooky, even scary, image.  Young, pretty, pink hoodie, then wham, you''re in a horror movie. Great juxtaposition.</td>', 'Spooky, even scary, image.  Young, pretty, pink hoodie, then wham, you''re in a horror movie. Great juxtaposition.', '2018-05-13 23:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568387, 1214511, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific thought and image, yet a bit oblique to the challenge.  Unless the person on the beach isn''t alive, then disregard that oblique business.  I like the imagery of water, which sustains us and also washes away our footsteps.  Going black and white enhances the mood.</td>', 'Terrific thought and image, yet a bit oblique to the challenge.  Unless the person on the beach isn''t alive, then disregard that oblique business.  I like the imagery of water, which sustains us and also washes away our footsteps.  Going black and white enhances the mood.', '2018-05-13 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568388, 1214234, 173844, '<td valign="top">Creepy scary.  Feels like you''re but inches from Lazrus''s embrace, certain doom.  The x-ray overtones ratchet up the fright.  Wonderful gauzy green curtain.</td>', 'Creepy scary.  Feels like you''re but inches from Lazrus''s embrace, certain doom.  The x-ray overtones ratchet up the fright.  Wonderful gauzy green curtain.', '2018-05-13 23:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568389, 1214528, 173844, '<td valign="top">Kinda cute, in an I want to rip out your liver sort of way.  This ashen-faced lad is very ably concocted, and the background is superb.  Very Nosferatu.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Kinda cute, in an I want to rip out your liver sort of way.  This ashen-faced lad is very ably concocted, and the background is superb.  Very Nosferatu.  I like this a lot.', '2018-05-13 23:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568390, 1214542, 68504, '<td valign="top">yes.</td>', 'yes.', '2018-05-13 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568391, 1214541, 173844, '<td valign="top">Imaginative image.  The emerging face is convincingly engulfed in this stuff.  A subjective quibble is that the squarish inner frame seems limiting.  What I like is that the viewer is required to make an effort to discover what''s going on.</td>', 'Imaginative image.  The emerging face is convincingly engulfed in this stuff.  A subjective quibble is that the squarish inner frame seems limiting.  What I like is that the viewer is required to make an effort to discover what''s going on.', '2018-05-13 23:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568392, 1214537, 68504, '<td valign="top">fetching</td>', 'fetching', '2018-05-13 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568393, 1214537, 173844, '<td valign="top">It feels like something evil has happened here, yet in a matter of fact way.  Some human-like creature has been skinned and hung from the rafters.  Yet the sun pours through the doorway highlighting the scene.  It feels medieval, like a painting by Breugel.  Very fine.  I wish I understood the title.</td>', 'It feels like something evil has happened here, yet in a matter of fact way.  Some human-like creature has been skinned and hung from the rafters.  Yet the sun pours through the doorway highlighting the scene.  It feels medieval, like a painting by Breugel.  Very fine.  I wish I understood the title.', '2018-05-13 23:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568394, 1214494, 173844, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry, the beagle will save you.  Or maybe hubby has just had a tough shift at the cemetery, a good night''s rest will take care of it.  This seems more camp than horror, and I''m enjoying it on that level.  If I''ve got it all wrong, sorry.  But I''m liking it.</td>', 'Don''t worry, the beagle will save you.  Or maybe hubby has just had a tough shift at the cemetery, a good night''s rest will take care of it.  This seems more camp than horror, and I''m enjoying it on that level.  If I''ve got it all wrong, sorry.  But I''m liking it.', '2018-05-14 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568396, 1214536, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and creative. My choice for the blue</td>', 'Beautiful and creative. My choice for the blue', '2018-05-14 00:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568397, 1214541, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative. Its obvious you are quite talented.</td>', 'Very imaginative. Its obvious you are quite talented.', '2018-05-14 00:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
