(7568403, 1214536, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great entry. Top 2.</td>', 'Great entry. Top 2.', '2018-05-14 00:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7568406, 1214544, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Ken. This is a wonderful tribute to Greg, and a fantastic effort to get it in in the nick of time. Maybe he was helping you.</td>', 'Congratulations Ken. This is a wonderful tribute to Greg, and a fantastic effort to get it in in the nick of time. Maybe he was helping you.', '2018-05-14 01:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7568410, 1214536, 123833, '<td valign="top">As you can see you got 36 votes, of these one 1, one 3, one 4 and six 5s. That makes 25% of voters who thought your image was below average. I find it very demotivating and frustrating, and the others must do as well as a lot of long time members dropped off recently, or come back occasionally for one month only (see Art''s comment, I think Anita did that too, Wendy has disappeared, you entered just one challenge in 10 months etc). It is a pity as Bear is working extremely hard to keep this site going with his new big title of Administrator, but without big additions of new ideas and their implementation in code (!!), it is mission impossible. Sorry, Bear, but this is the current reality. Your work is very appreciated.<br/> <br/>A very fine image, obviously deserving a much higher score as it would have happened when we had 100+ votes in each challenge and few low votes wouldn''t make much difference.<br/> <br/>PS My membership expires in a few days, I may let it lapse and maybe come for one month when I get motivated.</td>', 'As you can see you got 36 votes, of these one 1, one 3, one 4 and six 5s. That makes 25% of voters who thought your image was below average. I find it very demotivating and frustrating, and the others must do as well as a lot of long time members dropped off recently, or come back occasionally for one month only (see Art''s comment, I think Anita did that too, Wendy has disappeared, you entered just one challenge in 10 months etc). It is a pity as Bear is working extremely hard to keep this site going with his new big title of Administrator, but without big additions of new ideas and their implementation in code (!!), it is mission impossible. Sorry, Bear, but this is the current reality. Your work is very appreciated. A very fine image, obviously deserving a much higher score as it would have happened when we had 100+ votes in each challenge and few low votes wouldn''t make much difference. PS My membership expires in a few days, I may let it lapse and maybe come for one month when I get motivated.', '2018-05-14 02:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
