(7568494, 1214536, 124815, '<td valign="top">I believe that we are here for the love of photography as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a> shows in his work, specialized for a while in "extended editing". <br/>There are lots of challenges here of all kinds in which to participate and vote and more importantly, to articulate an opinion. <br/> <br/>"Haters" or taking the pulse of an image by its average score is superfluous. <br/>When does any work of art get an unanimous acclaim or its fair/unfair share of rotten tomatoes thrown at it? <br/> <br/></td>', 'I believe that we are here for the love of photography as  gyaban shows in his work, specialized for a while in "extended editing". There are lots of challenges here of all kinds in which to participate and vote and more importantly, to articulate an opinion.  "Haters" or taking the pulse of an image by its average score is superfluous. When does any work of art get an unanimous acclaim or its fair/unfair share of rotten tomatoes thrown at it?  ', '2018-05-15 20:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
