(7572037, 1214544, 67145, '<td valign="top">i opened this up and did a double take ... you know when you see something or someone you recognize but it doesnt compute immediately .. <br/>when the various synopses in my brain fired up i got emotional .. <br/>i was lucky i got to see greg only a couple of days before he passed away .. <br/>you have created a wonderful image here .. its crazy .. it really is like he''s looking at the camera you have in your hand ... but thats your gift .. creating magic with your photos .. <br/>i''ve read all you wrote about how you created this image and the time you had to do it in .. like no time .. i''m so pleased that you were able to get this into the challenge  .. <br/>its a great tribute to greg .. and i''m sure he''d absolutely love it .. xx<br/> <br/><i>oh .. and edit to add .. </i> <br/>CONGRATS ON THE BLUE ..!!.. <br/>usually that would be the most important thing to say .. but in this case thats almost secondary .. altho still wonderful .. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-06-16 08:05:29.</i></td>', 'i opened this up and did a double take ... you know when you see something or someone you recognize but it doesnt compute immediately .. when the various synopses in my brain fired up i got emotional .. i was lucky i got to see greg only a couple of days before he passed away .. you have created a wonderful image here .. its crazy .. it really is like he''s looking at the camera you have in your hand ... but thats your gift .. creating magic with your photos .. i''ve read all you wrote about how you created this image and the time you had to do it in .. like no time .. i''m so pleased that you were able to get this into the challenge  .. its a great tribute to greg .. and i''m sure he''d absolutely love it .. xx oh .. and edit to add ..  CONGRATS ON THE BLUE ..!!.. usually that would be the most important thing to say .. but in this case thats almost secondary .. altho still wonderful .. :)', '2018-06-16 09:02:51.000000', '2018-06-16 09:05:29.000000', 0),
